# Raw source payloads are large and fully reproducible from the pipeline.
# 151MB of cached HTML and the 54MB Chadwick register stay out of the repo.
data/raw/

# The interim and processed tables ARE committed (about 7MB). The deployed
# app needs them: Streamlit Community Cloud clones this repo and runs
# app.py, with no way to run a 20-minute crawl first.
!data/interim/
!data/processed/

